[{"title":"隐泉诗院杂咏和马专城韵八首 其七 临流","author":"成鹫","text":"俯弄溪流思渺然，一声长啸泬寥天。\n官情自是清如水，诗社应同白社禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50222,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隐泉诗院杂咏和马专城韵八首 其八 孝女墓","author":"成鹫","text":"蓬莱无路水无边，怅望朱明第七天。\n芗泽已抛金锁骨，化为白璧种蓝田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50223,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其一 西畴归牧","author":"成鹫","text":"陇上何人读汉书，长歌叩角来徐徐。\n清溪笑杀巢居父，不识沧浪尺半鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50224,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其二 南圃寻僧","author":"成鹫","text":"住山人访住山翁，相见生涯别也同。\n冷淡门庭煨芋火，炎凉世界卖松风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50225,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其三 白板邀凉","author":"成鹫","text":"绿水青山白板扉，蒲团长日坐披衣。\n独嫌褦襶频相过，领略南薰不细微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50226,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其四 幽径坐月","author":"成鹫","text":"曲径花光裛露漙，拥衾争爱夜珠寒。\n经归法藏禅归海，物外何人不受瞒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50227,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其五 鹊巢古树","author":"成鹫","text":"老树无枝不记年，养成雏鸴几翀天。\n无情也入那伽定，顶上安巢更宛然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50228,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其六 钟度前溪","author":"成鹫","text":"圆音疏节出空山，早晚重门未易关。\n萝月松风留不住，却随流水到人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50229,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其七 荷沼分题","author":"成鹫","text":"芰荷香散雨初收，词客临池觅胜游。\n折取碧筒无用处，侍儿珍重代诗筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50230,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双照八咏 其八 竹林煮茗","author":"成鹫","text":"幽篁寂寂水泠泠，茗色平分竹叶青。\n三拜下风思谂老，不妨从此废茶经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50231,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张煜生小影","author":"成鹫","text":"石砰恰好作书床，庭砌秋风竹簟凉。\n好与老僧分半座，梧桐清影不相妨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50232,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前参戎李元济手植双槐于庭下其子东园兄弟不忘手泽颜之为堂绘图徵诗赋此并识旧游 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"曾住马山山麓寺，古槐垂荫接芳邻。\n今来恰好披图看，识得堂中旧主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50233,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前参戎李元济手植双槐于庭下其子东园兄弟不忘手泽颜之为堂绘图徵诗赋此并识旧游 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"缓带轻裘物色佳，千年遗像见恢谐。\n光风霁月容疏放，射虎归来自种槐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50234,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前参戎李元济手植双槐于庭下其子东园兄弟不忘手泽颜之为堂绘图徵诗赋此并识旧游 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"种日条柯正及肩，于今桢干已参天。\n彤弓不待扶桑挂，影到花砖是日边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50235,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前参戎李元济手植双槐于庭下其子东园兄弟不忘手泽颜之为堂绘图徵诗赋此并识旧游 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"亭亭双干出群芳，莫负花时几度忙。\n为语丹青休草次，留将秋色待诸郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50236,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前参戎李元济手植双槐于庭下其子东园兄弟不忘手泽颜之为堂绘图徵诗赋此并识旧游 其五","author":"成鹫","text":"昔人手植卜三公，仙李蟠根此日同。\n珍重挥毫添九棘，一家都在画图中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50237,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前参戎李元济手植双槐于庭下其子东园兄弟不忘手泽颜之为堂绘图徵诗赋此并识旧游 其六","author":"成鹫","text":"芝兰凝碧茁公孙，庭砌花开静掩门。\n记得潜夫曾著讼，始知家学有渊源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50238,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题罗元宰四时行乐图 其一 杏圃飞觞","author":"成鹫","text":"大地花开处处春，出墙红杏一枝新。\n青州从事来相访，清浊凭君作主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50239,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题罗元宰四时行乐图 其二 莲池刻漏","author":"成鹫","text":"白社閒寻惠远师，花边闻漏独归迟。\n笑声乍落红尘外，应是溪桥送客时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50240,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题罗元宰四时行乐图 其三 丛桂啸歌","author":"成鹫","text":"仙桂秋香正好攀，一声清啸彩云间。\n明年又是黄花候，招隐无劳大小山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50241,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题罗元宰四时行乐图 其四 雪窗著述","author":"成鹫","text":"秦火犹存未烬书，渊源家学富三馀。\n分明古道照颜色，映雪寻行愧不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50242,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人宰楚邑","author":"成鹫","text":"渔父狂歌不可听，春江饯别酒初醒。\n醒来手抱瑶琴去，一曲薰风满洞庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50243,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下闻女道士吹笙 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"飘飘蕙质出风尘，皎皎长空月一轮。\n何事不随嵩岳去，齐门空作滥竽人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下闻女道士吹笙 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"十二金簧对月明，由庚谱作步虚声。\n何因不鼓湘娥瑟，空抱双成缱绻情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下闻女道士吹笙 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"月姊三更下碧城，灵匏一奏八风清。\n此声不与缑山别，鹤吹遥应杂凤鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下闻女道士吹笙 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"霓裳舞罢戴星冠，手握匏笙下广寒。\n一曲南陔声未歇，随风吹入采云端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一 水仙","author":"成鹫","text":"长抱平生水石心，仙葩相对理瑶琴。\n连成也解移情处，明月清风何待寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二 梅雀","author":"成鹫","text":"枯树无心作此奇，春风先到向南枝。\n生憎野雀无情谓，飞上梢头逐蝶儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其三 梨花白燕","author":"成鹫","text":"剪剪东风白雪香，乌衣宝树玉成行。\n昭阳莫道无颜色，净洗铅华见靓妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其四 萱草","author":"成鹫","text":"北堂曾种宜男草，几度春秋几度花。\n乐事世间应不少，忘忧宁待佩仙葩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其五 莲花","author":"成鹫","text":"日永朱明见物华，清池红藕正开花。\n荷衣恰称骚人服，翠盖亭亭罥紫霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其六 午时花葵花","author":"成鹫","text":"静坐亭阴影渐移，群芳相对却先知。\n丹心向日非无谓，碧砌花开正午时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其七 兰花","author":"成鹫","text":"何须九畹羡三湘，幽谷无人也自芳。\n莫道丹青芗泽少，却缘入室不闻香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其八 花下螳螂","author":"成鹫","text":"一径幽姿迥不同，漫随红紫笑春风。\n螳螂不是当车者，接叶攀条隐绿丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其九 莲池鱼鸟","author":"成鹫","text":"晴日芳园丽景舒，一池菱芡杂红蕖。\n閒心也有临渊兴，野鸟何妨亦羡鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其十 花瓜草虫蝶","author":"成鹫","text":"紫瓜垂蒂野花黄，群动蜎飞趁众芳。\n却笑蒙庄随物化，何如高枕梦羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其十一 白菊","author":"成鹫","text":"东篱秋老百花黄，灼灼幽姿淡淡妆。\n不羡南金堪比色，冰心先已许柴桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其十二 山茶","author":"成鹫","text":"绿叶丹葩迥自殊，何须琪树秀三株。\n清风袭袭生衣袂，一笑相看人姓卢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鸡冠花","author":"成鹫","text":"仙葩轮菌蕊珠团，疑是文禽顶上丹。\n纪渻养来形似木，独留绛帻倚阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"三岩高处曾相见，五老峰头念索居。\n何事玉渊书未报，水清难怪久无鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"名山不负古栖贤，种玉开云岂偶然。\n回首岭南笑顽石，点头不上米家船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"松老风高万壑涛，养成雏鹤待鸣皋。\n直林秋晚悲摇落，咫尺家山入望劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"三峡狂澜吼似雷，老人归路兴悠哉。\n南方龙象争相庆，夺食驱耕人又来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其五","author":"成鹫","text":"鶗鴂声声不忍闻，阴晴冷煖岭头分。\n人天有意留师住，捩转匡云入海云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其六","author":"成鹫","text":"旧游人境两茫茫，临老重来礼法王。\n觌面更无差别见，鬓边惟觉有微霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其七","author":"成鹫","text":"丹霞归路未逢人，依旧顽牛昨日身。\n莫怪适来还适去，溪山无地任吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泽萌和尚归自栖贤主海云席赠此 其八","author":"成鹫","text":"珍重浮山畜俊鹰，秋风飞击兴腾腾。\n于今大地多孤兔，六翮须丰养未曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与哉明师话别 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"吾道而今久寂寥，丹霞回首路迢迢。\n名山有约无筋力，且泥同参话一宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与哉明师话别 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"三间破屋无人到，一盏寒灯伴客眠。\n明发挂帆云外去，不堪重问再来缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与哉明师话别 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"隙中日月眼前尘，梦里行藏病后身。\n愁绝不堪更回首，青山多少未归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与哉明师话别 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"还他谷老三杯酒，输却羊昙一局棋。\n前路逢人如见讯，为言长处在愚痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"浓阴覆石数家村，断涧通桥曲绕门。\n拟借此间添结屋，经年车马不闻喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"深深结屋无人到，面面开窗见月明。\n过客不须频借问，百花香里读书声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"白石苍苔坐默然，桃花开落自年年。\n相逢指点居山乐，水满清溪月满天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"风静波恬一叶轻，丝纶高捲待潮生。\n沧浪歌罢浑无事，抱膝閒听瀑布声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其五","author":"成鹫","text":"扁舟移棹访仙源，策杖归来日欲昏。\n咫尺家园隔烟雨，山城临水未关门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其六","author":"成鹫","text":"石桥风雨少人行，江上征舠挂席轻。\n何似幽人睡方足，闭门欹枕听泉声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其七","author":"成鹫","text":"野人家住寒山下，雪重茅檐树低亚。\n得句吟来风满林，踏花归去香随马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海月","author":"成鹫","text":"天水茫茫光四垂，夜珠飞上珊瑚枝。\n老人独坐船头望，疑是扶桑浴日时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶杖","author":"成鹫","text":"欲展旗枪心已枯，乌藤白拂笑区区。\n自从识得赵州老，与夺方知辨有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拾翠词","author":"成鹫","text":"逐队寻芳路转赊，路旁嫩绿正抽芽。\n何因不入花林去，是处无花草当花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新筑落成梦一老僧修眉皓项趺坐门楣上云入定五千年矣梦中讶其不经赠之以诗实奇梦也醒而记之时癸未中秋后五夜","author":"成鹫","text":"僧老门高谁占先，相闻趺坐五千年。\n弥勒下生犹不起，蒲团铁铸也应穿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"时人莫笑宝光穷，珠树流丹拟梵宫。\n四面香风吹不断，火斋飞出海门东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"安居九夏足三冬，云影溪光紫翠重。\n树下枯禅成法喜，碧纱笼又绛纱封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"赪霞红雨暗西江，饱食归来卧北窗。\n午过空林喧鸟雀，馀香散入碧油幢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"攀枝投石笑群儿，活剥生吞不待时。\n时过更愁零落尽，中间消息几人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其五","author":"成鹫","text":"赤肉团中老衲衣，朝来赐紫自光辉。\n止应博得佳人笑，尽日红尘逐马飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其六","author":"成鹫","text":"嘉实无媒笑自誉，旁观珍重别侬渠。\n无端比作江鳐柱，沉李浮瓜也不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其七","author":"成鹫","text":"御园别后几荣枯，挂绿新尝味不殊。\n衫袖满携人尽笑，穷儿衣裓有明珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其八","author":"成鹫","text":"连林接叶失高低，垂手摩肩任取携。\n丹凤赤乌衔不去，留将鹤子与梅妻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其九","author":"成鹫","text":"晶盘朱实当清斋，蘸甲红螺未是佳。\n过客不须频驻足，林间滋味属吾侪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其十","author":"成鹫","text":"却妨车马损莓苔，果熟柴门昼不开。\n留得一枝诫猿雀，莫教攀折待宗雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其十一","author":"成鹫","text":"何堪紫陌逐红尘，独抱冰心懒赠人。\n若使桃花知此意，门前流水即迷津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其十二","author":"成鹫","text":"江城果市日纷纷，去逐蒲觞伴使君。\n林下相逢休问价，赤珠原不羡玄纁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其十三","author":"成鹫","text":"承筐从不到朱门，抱玉何须献紫阍。\n火枣张梨胥入贡，自甘憔悴老丘园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50296,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝词三十首寄张子白杨鬯侯 其十四","author":"成鹫","text":"细嚼凝冰沁肺肝，人间五月有新寒。\n何来褦襶门前客，赠与清凉散滞丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50297,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]